  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In the River of Time fight over Heavenly Court’s Immortal Gu Houses, Fang Yuan calls for Bing Sai Chuan to act. Bing Sai Chuan appears behind Present and Past Pavilion, pushes with both palms, and cold winds with frost energy cover the whole House. At the next moment the entire Present and Past Pavilion is sealed in transparent profound ice, and the three Xunzi inside are unmoving, with frightened expressions frozen on their faces.",
