    {
      "text": "On Eternal Yacht, Qing Ye names the immortal killer move immediate time freeze and identifies Bing Sai Chuan as the time path great expert of Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s era. Bing Sai Chuan cultivates time path and is most skilled at freezing time; his time path killer moves can imitate the effects of ice path. He is a rank eight legend whose peak battle strength sits on the same level as Li Huang.",
